🔹 1. Top Performing Sectors by Transactions

SELECT Sector, SUM(Transactions) AS Total_Transactions
FROM wps_clients
GROUP BY Sector

ORDER BY Total_Transactions DESC;

Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Construction and Logistics sectors usually top the list.

Use a bar chart to show sector vs total transactions.

🔹 2. Average Payout per Employee by Sector

SELECT Sector, 
       ROUND(AVG(Monthly_Payout / Employees), 2) AS Avg_Payout_Per_Employee
FROM wps_clients
GROUP BY Sector
ORDER BY Avg_Payout_Per_Employee DESC;

Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Logistics and IT sectors often have higher payout per employee.

Visual: column chart or KPI card showing avg payout per employee per sector.

🔹 3. Regional Client Distribution

SELECT Region, COUNT(Client_ID) AS Total_Clients
FROM wps_clients
GROUP BY Region
ORDER BY Total_Clients DESC;
Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Dubai may have the highest number of clients.

Visual: pie chart or map visual to show client distribution by region.

🔹 4. Monthly Total Transactions (Trend)

SELECT Month, SUM(Transactions) AS Total_Transactions
FROM wps_clients
GROUP BY Month
ORDER BY FIELD(Month, 'Jan','Feb','Mar','Apr','May','Jun','Jul','Aug','Sep','Oct','Nov','Dec');
Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Track seasonal trends; January is sample month here.

Visual: line chart showing monthly transaction trends.

🔹 5. Sector Share Percentage of Total Transactions

SELECT Sector, 
       ROUND(SUM(Transactions) * 100.0 / (SELECT SUM(Transactions) FROM wps_clients), 2) AS Percentage_Share
FROM wps_clients
GROUP BY Sector
ORDER BY Percentage_Share DESC;
Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Shows which sectors contribute most to WPS adoption.

Visual: donut chart or 100% stacked bar chart.

🔹 6. Average Employees per Sector

SELECT Sector, ROUND(AVG(Employees), 2) AS Avg_Employees
FROM wps_clients
GROUP BY Sector
ORDER BY Avg_Employees DESC;
Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Helps identify large vs small companies by sector.

Visual: bar chart or scatter plot.

🔹 7. Top 5 Companies by Monthly Payout

SELECT Company_Name, Monthly_Payout
FROM wps_clients
ORDER BY Monthly_Payout DESC
LIMIT 5;
Observation / Reference for Visuals:

Highlight top clients contributing to revenue.

Visual: table or bar chart.

🧾 Insights (from the dataset)

Sector Performance: Construction (highest transactions), followed by Logistics and Retail.

Average Payout per Employee: Highest in Logistics and IT, lowest in Services.

Regional Distribution: Dubai and Abu Dhabi dominate client numbers; Ajman and Sharjah growing steadily.

Top Companies: Al Noor Contracting, Desert Logistics, and Metro Electrics contribute most to payouts.
